  "description": "I was just living quietly alone for 300 years, and suddenly humans barged in and held a soul marriage ceremony without my consent.\nAnd of all things, with an 8-year-old brat.\n\nBut this kid—can't do a single thing properly,\nis a total troublemaker, and just roasts potatoes to eat every single day…?\n\nFine. Since I feel sorry for them, I'll cook them a little food.\nHelp out a little with the laundry too—and kick them out as soon as they're all grown up.\nBecause I have absolutely zero intention of getting involved with humans!\n\nA bizarre married life (?) story of a ghost bride, Ria, and her little groom, Lucian.\n\n_Source: PolarFox Comic, translated_",
